      "id": "claim_7dbd366fa1284eb78f4072b133f8eb9d",
      "statement": "optionalAuth (attaches identity when a valid bearer token is present, ignores verification failures, never blocks) is exported but imported by no route in the repository. The public catalog routers (datasheets, changelog) mount no auth middleware at all, so no live endpoint ever populates userId without requiring it.",
