    {
      "id": "claim_cd22daaf3f55435783918cd60daf2900",
      "statement": "packages/db-client/prisma/rls-policies.sql (ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY plus policies on user_armies, user_unit_media, user_color_schemes keyed on the Supabase-style auth.uid()) is dead configuration: no Prisma migration contains CREATE POLICY or the auth.uid() function, nothing in the repo references the file, and both migration paths (apps/api/entrypoint.sh and scripts/dev-container.sh `db`) run only `prisma migrate deploy` (plus seed.ts). Application-level userId scoping is therefore the real and only tenant-isolation enforcement, not a DB backstop.",
